{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1334027-youth-restoring-dhampir-malison","id":1334027,"title":"Youth Restoring Dhampir Malison","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-04T15:13:43-07:00","id":1334027,"title":"Youth Restoring Dhampir Malison","content":"An Idea I had a bit ago was a Youth Restoring Dhampir Malison Ideally Involving a Blood Bath and <i>needing at </i>least one death.<br /> <br /> Think this is Themantic for Dhampirs?<br /> <br /> It said I know they simply cant be embraced but I think its ok for some to have found other routes to immortality.<br /> <br /> I think it would be cool in a hunters Game looking into a pair of mysterious disapperances.<br /> <br /> <br /> If we grant it is Themantic, how you think Covenants Especialy Sanctum and Crone would View it?<br /> <br /> As Blasphemy?<br /> <br /> Invictus would worry about them getting too big for their britches. but might think its ok if it keeps a Valued Servant and Child around.<br /> <br /> no Idea what Carthians would think<br /> <br /> Ordo Dracul see something to do experiments on and try to refine and perfect?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 09-05-2019, 03:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-06T17:57:50-07:00","id":1334269,"title":"","content":"Seems thematic to me. I see the Invictus being wary, the Lance not approving, the Circle being perfectly fine with it, and the Ordo noting it in the file for that experimental Dhampir.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T07:17:03-07:00","id":1334453,"title":"","content":"Hmmmn One Question should it be only usable On oneself or on another Mortal (Likely in return for outrageous sums of money or some such?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T15:25:40-07:00","id":1334544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1334027-youth-restoring-dhampir-malison?p=1334453#post1334453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmmn One Question should it be only usable On oneself or on another Mortal (Likely in return for outrageous sums of money or some such?)</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd <i>personally </i>say only on Dhampir (but it could be used on other Dhampir, not just oneself). Or at least, it should work much better on Dhampir (longer duration or less cost, perhaps).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T23:41:57-07:00","id":1334769,"title":"","content":"Hmmmn Maybe Require a Kindreds aid When using it on a normal mortal. thus letting the Dhampir in question be as bitchy and picky as he wants and Fit into a hunter game as an antagonist...<br /> <br /> One thing how many murders should it take?<br /> <br /> As to be enemies in a hunter game they need to be tracking down the murders or kidnappings when another one happens?<br /> <br /> oh hows this idea sound?<br /> <br /> Each time They use the Malison on a particular person the number of people that must die to Rejuvenate them goes up.<br /> <br /> Say number of Times They've been so rejuvenated squared? <br /> <br /> So when their a millenia and a half old and need Rejuvenated the 40th time theyd need 1600 people<br /> <br /> <br /> That is A LOT of human trafficking... If you can keep it hidden you deserve immortality.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 09-11-2019, 12:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-13T19:59:24-07:00","id":1335647,"title":"","content":"I would be very hesitant to add any abilities that would allow immortality to the Dhampir since they\u2019re explicitly can not get embraced or ghouled which are the two ways the Vampire line gives immortality so doing so seems to undermine author intent. Furthermore Malison\u2019s cost life they don\u2019t give it so I don\u2019t believe such a power to be a good thematic fit.<br /> That said it\u2019s your game and if you want to do it then do it, I might allow it if I was the ST but I would not try to make such an ability canon. <br /> Also nothing prevents mixing minor templates so just giving them a second template (possibly made up on the spot) could neatly solve the problem. Since this seems to be to make an NPC I don\u2019t think it matters much anyway, freaky things happen.<br /> If I did allow it for a player I would probably say that it required killing another Dhampir just to keep the Dhampirs must shed blood for the benefit of a Malison to work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T11:09:32-07:00","id":1335755,"title":"","content":"hows it sound as a idea for antagonist in a Hunter Chronicle? With the number of people who must be sacrificed going up each time<br /> <br /> 1,4,9,16,25,36,49..64,81,100,121,144,169,196,225,2 56,289,324,361.400,441484,529,576 625,676,729,784,841,900,961,1024,1089, 1156, 1225, 1296<br /> <br /> Slowly but surely climbing Higher and Higher.<br /> <br /> <br /> Huners would probaly notice that many disappearing people or even human trafficking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 09-30-2019, 11:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T20:33:09-07:00","id":1335832,"title":"","content":"Fine, antagonists have better things to do than be completely rules legal and it\u2019s extra ok because none of the players are going to be in a position to ask for a similar ability.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T11:12:56-07:00","id":1335921,"title":"","content":"does the Geometric increase in lives Required sound good?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T09:45:48-07:00","id":1336232,"title":"","content":"Seems fine, is that per year? It could get out of hand if left too long but I assume your players will be dealing with it before it does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T17:55:47-07:00","id":1336396,"title":"","content":"Was thinking Every time they need Rejuvenated<br /> <br /> <br /> Every 50 or 60 years or so? <br /> <br /> Does that mean it take using it 7 or 8 times Before the disappearing persons reports get odd?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T02:26:48-07:00","id":1336518,"title":"","content":"They can move around, there\u2019s probably an FBI file (or equivalent if not in America) on the last time they did it maybe listing them as a survivor since no one ever found the old man who did the deed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T06:01:41-07:00","id":1336538,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1334027-youth-restoring-dhampir-malison?p=1335647#post1335647\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would be very hesitant to add any abilities that would allow immortality to the Dhampir since they\u2019re explicitly can not get embraced or ghouled which are the two ways the Vampire line gives immortality so doing so seems to undermine author intent. Furthermore Malison\u2019s cost life they don\u2019t give it so I don\u2019t believe such a power to be a good thematic fit.<br /> That said it\u2019s your game and if you want to do it then do it, I might allow it if I was the ST but I would not try to make such an ability canon.<br /> Also nothing prevents mixing minor templates so just giving them a second template (possibly made up on the spot) could neatly solve the problem. Since this seems to be to make an NPC I don\u2019t think it matters much anyway, freaky things happen.<br /> If I did allow it for a player I would probably say that it required killing another Dhampir just to keep the Dhampirs must shed blood for the benefit of a Malison to work.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> To this point, nothing keeps you from adding the Blood Bather minor template to a Dhampir. <br /> <br /> To reiterate my own record on this, I think the author's approach to Dhampir is regressive and nothing is gained by denying them either ghoul or embrace. The drawbacks inherent to the dhampir are explicit and layered, and achieving ghoul status won't change them. Being embraced of course wipes minor templates. I could go on and on in this vein (haha), but that's not the point of the thread.<br /> <br /> Now to touch on the motivations of the Dhampir NPC under consideration, it is entirely thematically appropriate for a character to use their familiarity with the supernatural and the potency of blood to seek elaborate and costly ways to prolong their life and youth. In the CofD that is achievable but has... consequences.<br /> <br /> --Khanwulf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12493-khanwulf","name":"Khanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-15T22:55:22-07:00","id":1341577,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Khanwulf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1334027-youth-restoring-dhampir-malison?p=1336538#post1336538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> To this point, nothing keeps you from adding the Blood Bather minor template to a Dhampir.<br /> <br /> To reiterate my own record on this, I think the author's approach to Dhampir is regressive and nothing is gained by denying them either ghoul or embrace. The drawbacks inherent to the dhampir are explicit and layered, and achieving ghoul status won't change them. Being embraced of course wipes minor templates. I could go on and on in this vein (haha), but that's not the point of the thread.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know, being Dhampir sounds like just <b>the</b> right thing to taint one's embrace and lead to the kind of weird colaterals that spawn bloodlines in 2e....<br /> And for maximum irony, it's <i>the sire</i> who gets tainted/changed by consuming, then embracing the Dhampir. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 10-16-2019, 01:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-16T12:08:32-07:00","id":1341672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1334027-youth-restoring-dhampir-malison?p=1341577#post1341577\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't know, being Dhampir sounds like just <b>the</b> right thing to taint one's embrace and lead to the kind of weird colaterals that spawn bloodlines in 2e....<br /> And for maximum irony, it's <i>the sire</i> who gets tainted/changed by consuming, then embracing the Dhampir. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> See? That wasn't hard! <br /> <br /> I'm a bit embittered by the book, to be plain, and find Dhampir, ghouls and to a lesser extent even revenants to be miserly-treated. It really felt backwards given what could have been a feast of optional treatments for minor templates. <br /> <br /> Dhampir in particular are crying out for more freeform exploration of <i>just what they mean</i> in the context of other vampiric existence. They could be the bridge between the Blood and all manner of really strange and unique supernatural manifestations thrust, unwelcomed into the (staid) Night.<br /> <br /> Clearly that tinkling sound is me tossing the Dhampir rails through the window, hard.<br /> <br /> Dhampir should be weird and rare. Or... hell, even weird and freakishly common? What if &quot;I really want to have a baby! [/Willpower dot]&quot; is all it takes to conceive a Dhampir on any given night? (Ok, add a &quot;partner&quot;, too.) What if some significant percentage of the population is walking around half-blooded? What might the implications be for Kindred? <br /> <br /> <br /> --Khanwulf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12493-khanwulf","name":"Khanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-16T13:29:14-07:00","id":1341698,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Khanwulf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1334027-youth-restoring-dhampir-malison?p=1341672#post1341672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> See? That wasn't hard!<br /> <br /> I'm a bit embittered by the book, to be plain, and find Dhampir, ghouls and to a lesser extent even revenants to be miserly-treated. It really felt backwards given what could have been a feast of optional treatments for minor templates.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, honestly i have little to no qualms about mixing and matching bits from ghouls, ghoul families, sons of phobos and whichever ever &quot;BP 0 wicked dead&quot; piques my fancy.<br /> With dhampir and revenants i have yet to seriously play due to my snail pace with updating myself into 2nd edition. what can one say, age makes us lazy at times.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}